core identity of this folder:

    grounded in:
        scripture "For other foundation can no man lay than that is laid, which is Jesus Christ."
            from 1 Corinthians 3:11 in KJV
        principle "Foundational plans establish the base upon which everything else builds"
        anchor "And God divided the light from the darkness"
            from Genesis 1:4 in KJV

    serves as Void:
